### ScarborMusic — Search & Charts API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Search
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Search by song title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=midnight&limit=10

### Expected:
# { "data": { "songs": [...], "total": N, "page": 1, "pages": M } }

### 1b. Search by artist name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=TestDev&limit=10

### 1c. Search by album
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=album&limit=10

### 1d. Paginated search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=song&page=1&limit=5

### 1e. Short query (< 3 chars — uses LIKE fallback)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=te&limit=10

### 1f. Empty query (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search

### 1g. No results
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=xyznonexistent12345&limit=10

### Expected: { "data": { "songs": [], "total": 0 } }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Search Suggestions
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Get suggestions for prefix
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/suggest?q=mid

### Expected:
# { "data": [{ "text": "Midnight Dreams", "type": "song" }, ...] }
# (cached in Redis for 60 seconds)

### 2b. Artist name suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/suggest?q=Test

### 2c. Empty query (returns empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/suggest

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Trigger Play Count (to populate charts)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Play a song (login required)
# First login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testdev@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### 3b. Play song multiple times (replace SONG_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play

### Expected each time:
# { "data": { "playCount": "N", "redisCount": N } }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Charts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. All-time charts (top 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/charts?type=all&limit=50

### Expected:
# { "data": { "type": "all", "charts": [{ "rank": 1, "score": N, "song": {...} }] } }

### 4b. Daily charts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/charts?type=daily&limit=10

### 4c. Weekly charts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/charts?type=weekly&limit=10

### 4d. Monthly charts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/charts?type=monthly&limit=10

### 4e. Charts with limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/charts?type=all&limit=3

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Cache Verification
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Verify Redis cache via CLI:
# docker exec scarbormusic-redis redis-cli ZRANGE song:charts 0 -1 WITHSCORES
# Expected: [songId, score, songId, score, ...]

# Verify search suggest cache:
# docker exec scarbormusic-redis redis-cli GET "search:suggest:mid"
# Expected: JSON array of suggestions

# Verify chart cache TTL:
# docker exec scarbormusic-redis redis-cli TTL "charts:all"
# Expected: 1-300 (seconds remaining)
